<Base title="Disclosures" description="Transparency about affiliate links, advertising, and other disclosures.">
  <div class="prose prose-lg mx-auto py-12 px-4">
    <h1>Disclosures</h1>
    <p>This page provides transparency regarding affiliate links, advertising, and other relationships on WitchClick.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>WitchClick participates in various affiliate marketing programs, which means we may get paid commissions on editorially chosen products purchased through our links to retailer sites. Our editorial content is not influenced by advertisers or affiliate partnerships.</p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>This site may contain advertisements, sponsored content, paid insertions, or other forms of monetization. We strive to ensure that advertising is clearly identified and does not interfere with your experience.</p>

    <h2>Transparency</h2>
    <p>Our goal is to provide valuable, authentic content. We only recommend products or services that we genuinely believe will be of interest and benefit to our audience.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
